ht<ul><li>Light is the herald of morality</li> <li>Light beats back the darkness</li> <li>Light brings hope</li> <li>Light brings inspiration</li> <li>Light is all positive emotions</li> <li>Light may return out of the darkness</li> <li>Light is the truth</li> </ul>Sound<ul><li>Sound is the confirmation of existence</li> <li>Sound is the breaking of silence</li> <li>Sound is what makes us notice</li> </ul>Spirit<ul><li>Spirit is animism</li> <li>Spirit is the foundation of the soul</li> <li>Spirit is what each and every physical object and concept has</li> <li>Spirit is the appropriate mood in a situation</li> </ul>Taint<ul><li>Taint is the rot and corruption of physical objects and morality</li> </ul>Weather<ul><li>Weather is what sets the mood for a day</li> <li>Weather is a physical event</li> </ul>Wind<ul><li>Wind dances through the sky</li> <li>Wind is a destructive force of nature</li> <li>Wind is what holds all gases</li> <li>Wind cannot be contained</li> </ul></div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks so much for the help and I promise you that I didn't intend to copy Siren in this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-25T14:29:36-07:00","id":993101,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div cla